{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toots of Determination</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Six Legendary Tracks. One Unstable Trombone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dog has done it again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNDERTALE and DELTARUNE are now officially part of the world\u2019s most off-key rhythm game. That\u2019s right! Your slide-to-glory journey now includes the ability to absolutely obliterate clergy with an edgy, modern take on <i>Megalovania</i>. Or take the pacifist route and hold onto your HOPES and DREAMS while aiming for the highest Champ Streak. No matter how you play, the most important journey is the one you take with family and friends.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This paid DLC invites players to toot, honk, and glissando their way through six legendary bangers from two of the most beloved RPGs of all time. The UNDERTALE + DELTARUNE Song Pack brings a whole new level of chaos (<i>and possibly spiritual awakening)</i> to your trombone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Songs from UNDERTALE:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hopes and Dreams ~ SAVE the World</i> \u2013 now with 100% more vibrato.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle Against a True Hero</i> \u2013 your trombone is not ready.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Megalovania</i> \u2013 this is the sound of judgment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 Songs from DELTARUNE:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BIG SHOT</i> \u2013 you know what time it is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Black Knife</i> \u2013 edgy. moody. trombone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The World Revolving</i> \u2013 now revolving in a circle of regret.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610400?t=1755014812","background_r